-- refusal
type: System.ArgumentException
message: the moved-field key `a'b` carries `'`, and this key is rendered into the statement as a SQL string literal so that an expression index over the same literal can be matched. Only the lowercase letters, digits and underscores a generated column name is made of are accepted: a name that needed an escape is a name OrmGenerator could not have emitted, so it is refused here rather than quietly quote-doubled. (Parameter 'name')
